# Design Journal

## WK5 — Project Kickoff

**Date: 09/28/2026**

**Where things stand:**
Just getting started. Repo is set up, README drafted with the project's core idea: 
a customizable comp-tracking app for TFT players, replacing the scattered spreadsheets 
most players (myself included) currently use.

**Thinking so far:**
Still deciding on the tech stack and exact feature set for the first prototype. Leaning 
toward keeping the MVP scope tight (basic comp entry and note-taking) before adding 
anything more ambitious.

**Biggest open question:**
What tech stack to use, since app development is outside my usual cybersecurity/sysadmin 
background. Planning to spend the early part of this phase researching options.

**Next up:**
Finalize tech stack, set up the dev environment, start scoping core features.

